    title: "Fast Food",
    developer: Some("Don Ruffcorn"),
    description: Some("Mighty Mouth — a pair of disembodied lips — snaps up burgers, fries, drinks and other fast food as it streaks past, scoring by the calorie, while the pace ratchets up with each mocking \"YOU\'RE GETTING FATTER.\" The purple pickles are poison, though: gulp down six and the mouth lets out a \"BURP!\" and the diner slams shut."),
